contentText:
Selena Gomez and her Wizards of Waverly Place family are giving fans one last look at the behind-the-scenes magic of their franchise, with the singer-actress sharing her thoughts about saying goodbye to Alex Russo in honor of spin-off Wizards Beyond Waverly Place &#8216;s four-part finale that dropped Tuesday (Aug. 4).

